{"3464790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pinewater", "steam_appid": 3464790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leave the rush behind and make the lakeside your own.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinewater is a cozy first-person fishing game set around a peaceful lake. Restore a run-down cabin, care for the nature around you, and slowly turn the forgotten lakeshore into a place that feels like home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no need to hurry. Spend your days fishing, exploring the lake, improving your surroundings, or simply enjoying the scenery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fish at your own pace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your line in peaceful fishing spots and discover a variety of fish living around the lake. Search for rare catches, hunt down legendary fish, and see just how big your next catch can be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464790/extras/da4a582e9ccb52f96e2229f4594efd9a.poster.avif?t=1786979863\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464790/extras/da4a582e9ccb52f96e2229f4594efd9a.webm?t=1786979863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464790/extras/da4a582e9ccb52f96e2229f4594efd9a.mp4?t=1786979863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restore your lakeside home</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cabin and its surroundings have seen better days. Clean up, restore and improve the area little by little, transforming an abandoned lakeside into your own cozy retreat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464790/extras/61cf8989262355413c474e094bb765a6.poster.avif?t=1786979863\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464790/extras/61cf8989262355413c474e094bb765a6.webm?t=1786979863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464790/extras/61cf8989262355413c474e094bb765a6.mp4?t=1786979863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shape the nature around you</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut down and plant trees to shape the landscape around your lakeside home. Open up new spaces, replant trees where you want them, and gradually make the surroundings feel uniquely yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464790/extras/1842097a0cfd0f6d744b364b3eff8e26.poster.avif?t=1786979863\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464790/extras/1842097a0cfd0f6d744b364b3eff8e26.webm?t=1786979863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464790/extras/1842097a0cfd0f6d744b364b3eff8e26.mp4?t=1786979863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make the place your own</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place furniture, decorations and useful objects around the lakeside. Create cozy fishing spots, relaxing places to sit, and small corners that make the world feel uniquely yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464790/extras/fb7fe6e39c82422eafb19b6d977e4fb5.poster.avif?t=1786979863\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464790/extras/fb7fe6e39c82422eafb19b6d977e4fb5.webm?t=1786979863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464790/extras/fb7fe6e39c82422eafb19b6d977e4fb5.mp4?t=1786979863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the lake</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander along the shore or head out onto the water and discover different fishing spots and peaceful corners of Pinewater.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464790/extras/8b58111b680c87bf8acd0ee627e56826.poster.avif?t=1786979863\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464790/extras/8b58111b680c87bf8acd0ee627e56826.webm?t=1786979863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464790/extras/8b58111b680c87bf8acd0ee627e56826.mp4?t=1786979863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No rush. No pressure.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no right way to spend a day in Pinewater. Chase your next legendary catch, work on the cabin, decorate the lakeside, explore, or simply enjoy the quiet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing first-person fishing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare and legendary fish to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore a run-down lakeside cabin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate and customize your surroundings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant trees and shape the landscape your way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the lake by foot and boat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play entirely at your own pace</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leave the rush behind and make the lakeside your own.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinewater is a cozy first-person fishing game set around a peaceful lake. Restore a run-down cabin, care for the nature around you, and slowly turn the forgotten lakeshore into a place that feels like home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no need to hurry. Spend your days fishing, exploring the lake, improving your surroundings, or simply enjoying the scenery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fish at your own pace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your line in peaceful fishing spots and discover a variety of fish living around the lake. Search for rare catches, hunt down legendary fish, and see just how big your next catch can be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464790/extras/da4a582e9ccb52f96e2229f4594efd9a.poster.avif?t=1786979863\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464790/extras/da4a582e9ccb52f96e2229f4594efd9a.webm?t=1786979863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464790/extras/da4a582e9ccb52f96e2229f4594efd9a.mp4?t=1786979863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restore your lakeside home</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cabin and its surroundings have seen better days. Clean up, restore and improve the area little by little, transforming an abandoned lakeside into your own cozy retreat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464790/extras/61cf898926235541